8x+15 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can solve this equation by completing the square, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-8x+16+15 & =0+16 \\\\ (x-4)^{2}+15 & =16 \\\\ (x-4)^{2} & =1 \\\\ x-4 & =\\pm 1 \\\\ x & =4\\pm 1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the $x$-intercepts occur at the points $(3,0)$ and $(5,0).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-54228/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8b022811-fdd6-56a1-92ee-388e7ea53a4c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-54228"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-15471/selection/057609ae52dae097ea3d160863803bac25f89fdd6504c340b5935075b8dc2f72" :answer/id #uuid "fcdf2158-3d8a-5577-a89c-c0df108c953b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$(1,0)$ and $(10,0)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-15471/selection/06ff5071a0434a097b446e01bf7eed6165e503263a759ec2e533305e33d8daf6" :answer/id #uuid "dcc06385-baa7-55c8-8c76-d5a77b5f8a20" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$(2,0)$ and $(12,0)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-15471/selection/db8b5bc619b221ff0b01cfae5d4408aa4abf6df40b69f16fec8678a77cf1703f" :answer/id #uuid "546f2032-21f5-59b2-a85b-59b5f7a0dce3" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$(3-\\sqrt{7},0)$ and $(3+\\sqrt{7},0)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-15471/selection/da38d63d273f5fced48b6a35906ca025fb6a54b561b610eb05711cc3efcd2894" :answer/id #uuid "c68c7ff9-ef71-5444-8b2e-bd8e379d5ea2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$(3-\\sqrt{5},0)$ and $(3+\\sqrt{5},0)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-15471/selection/c39f987300487c58899164a3a7f2388ef80d0d75cbbc333ae8dee53a449e32b2" :answer/id #uuid "d028f383-5074-5ba8-a4ea-3fa28fe1ad90" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$(3-\\sqrt{6},0)$ and $(3+\\sqrt{6},0)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-15471/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "45b74600-dd65-5daf-a0bb-21f135aef473" :answer-f